  "0x379963c": "flag word of a zero Decimal: the mantissa stays 0 through the scale, so the result is 0 either way",
  "0x3799640": "flag word of a zero Decimal: the mantissa stays 0 through the scale, so the result is 0 either way",
  "0x3799643": "flag word of a zero Decimal: the mantissa stays 0 through the scale, so the result is 0 either way",
